# Stop the default proof transport and enter stopped STEP REC.
100 btn 12
200 btn 13

# FX tap is REST: arm on down, commit EMPTY on release.
250 btndown 2
300 btnup 2

# SELECT alone is TIE.
350 btn 3

# Hold FX then SELECT is NOTE OFF. Releasing FX afterward must NOT add REST.
400 btndown 2
450 btn 3
500 btnup 2

# The next ordinary note must therefore land immediately after OFF (step 3).
550 keys 1
600 keys 0

# Pending REST cancelled by HOME must not write on later FX release.
650 btndown 2
700 btn 8
750 btnup 2

# Re-enter STEP REC while still stopped and add a TIE at the unchanged cursor.
800 btn 13
850 btn 3

# REC exit cancels pending REST too.
900 btndown 2
950 btn 13
1000 btnup 2

# Re-enter, arm FX, then PLAY. PLAY exits STEP REC and cancels the pending REST
# before resuming playback. The edited sequence is REST, TIE, OFF, F3, TIE.
1050 btn 13
1100 btndown 2
1150 btn 12
1200 btnup 2

1600 end
